{"3982690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pocket Racer Shop Sim", "steam_appid": 3982690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Pocket Racer Shop Sim</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build. Customize. Race. Collect.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket Racer Shop Sim is a chill shop simulator with deep racing customization. Run your dream shop as you expand your shop floor size and inventory offering. Open up the booster packs to collect new parts with various stats to improve your Pocket Racer's performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/011a5264146ee9fc7d44ee5694056d0d.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/011a5264146ee9fc7d44ee5694056d0d.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/011a5264146ee9fc7d44ee5694056d0d.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint the walls, floors and ceilings as well as adjust the lighting to dial in the vibe of your shop. Purchase decorations to further express your shop's style. Change every piece of furniture on the shop floor from tracks to shelves to create a space that feels completely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/46fdb498ed46dc7ad825dffae568ed80.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/46fdb498ed46dc7ad825dffae568ed80.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/46fdb498ed46dc7ad825dffae568ed80.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Parts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open booster packs to start collecting new parts for your Pocket Racer garage. To build the best Pocket Racer you'll need to chase rare finds and constantly refine your cars' setups based on the track layouts.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/bf0e05ffc90db44953fbdb302c80f1ba.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/bf0e05ffc90db44953fbdb302c80f1ba.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/bf0e05ffc90db44953fbdb302c80f1ba.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build &amp; Tune Your Racer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the workbench you'll be able to mix and match parts to adjust performance to meet the track conditions. Every part has a rating that will affect your car's overall rating. This allows players to min max for the best car at each rating allowing players to restrict races by rating level or hold open races to see who can build the ultimate machine.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1a34af8384d5cc94a347b213658e9c4a.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1a34af8384d5cc94a347b213658e9c4a.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1a34af8384d5cc94a347b213658e9c4a.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race, Progress, &amp; Unlock New Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your assembled Pocket Racers out onto the track against shoppers or friends online. As your shop expands you'll unlock more tracks to race on and require mastering but with your shop expansion comes more difficult competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/80b8b3ca8d7f961cb26fa93bb4f41673.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/80b8b3ca8d7f961cb26fa93bb4f41673.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/80b8b3ca8d7f961cb26fa93bb4f41673.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the Track Builder app to design your own custom race track creations. Workshop integration is planned allowing players to share their builds and download other players' tracks giving you loads of variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/dd755460dbd4d455d1a7c8f668c1fb3e.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/dd755460dbd4d455d1a7c8f668c1fb3e.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/dd755460dbd4d455d1a7c8f668c1fb3e.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends over to your shop to help run the store or throw down on your latest track setup. Multiplayer is designed so players can take their singleplayer progression online with friends while bringing back anything purchased from those sessions to their own shop. This creates a seamless experience allowing you to jump in and out of each other's shops whether it be just visiting or helping run a busy day.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Pocket Racer Shop Sim</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build. Customize. Race. Collect.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket Racer Shop Sim is a chill shop simulator with deep racing customization. Run your dream shop as you expand your shop floor size and inventory offering. Open up the booster packs to collect new parts with various stats to improve your Pocket Racer's performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/011a5264146ee9fc7d44ee5694056d0d.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/011a5264146ee9fc7d44ee5694056d0d.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/011a5264146ee9fc7d44ee5694056d0d.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint the walls, floors and ceilings as well as adjust the lighting to dial in the vibe of your shop. Purchase decorations to further express your shop's style. Change every piece of furniture on the shop floor from tracks to shelves to create a space that feels completely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/46fdb498ed46dc7ad825dffae568ed80.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/46fdb498ed46dc7ad825dffae568ed80.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/46fdb498ed46dc7ad825dffae568ed80.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Parts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open booster packs to start collecting new parts for your Pocket Racer garage. To build the best Pocket Racer you'll need to chase rare finds and constantly refine your cars' setups based on the track layouts.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/bf0e05ffc90db44953fbdb302c80f1ba.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/bf0e05ffc90db44953fbdb302c80f1ba.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/bf0e05ffc90db44953fbdb302c80f1ba.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build &amp; Tune Your Racer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the workbench you'll be able to mix and match parts to adjust performance to meet the track conditions. Every part has a rating that will affect your car's overall rating. This allows players to min max for the best car at each rating allowing players to restrict races by rating level or hold open races to see who can build the ultimate machine.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1a34af8384d5cc94a347b213658e9c4a.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1a34af8384d5cc94a347b213658e9c4a.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/1a34af8384d5cc94a347b213658e9c4a.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race, Progress, &amp; Unlock New Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your assembled Pocket Racers out onto the track against shoppers or friends online. As your shop expands you'll unlock more tracks to race on and require mastering but with your shop expansion comes more difficult competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/80b8b3ca8d7f961cb26fa93bb4f41673.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/80b8b3ca8d7f961cb26fa93bb4f41673.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/80b8b3ca8d7f961cb26fa93bb4f41673.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the Track Builder app to design your own custom race track creations. Workshop integration is planned allowing players to share their builds and download other players' tracks giving you loads of variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/dd755460dbd4d455d1a7c8f668c1fb3e.poster.avif?t=1788223848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/dd755460dbd4d455d1a7c8f668c1fb3e.webm?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/dd755460dbd4d455d1a7c8f668c1fb3e.mp4?t=1788223848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends over to your shop to help run the store or throw down on your latest track setup. Multiplayer is designed so players can take their singleplayer progression online with friends while bringing back anything purchased from those sessions to their own shop. This creates a seamless experience allowing you to jump in and out of each other's shops whether it be just visiting or helping run a busy day.</p>", "short_description": "Create the ultimate Pocket Racer hobby shop. Stock the shelves, open car packs, build miniature race cars and expand your store over time. Design custom tracks and invite your friends over to help run the shop or to throw down on the latest track setup.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/be31cfe07e856e2af76c6bf62a18f7d6fa626d24/header.jpg?t=1788223848", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/62797bf89c3f1722a3